NAME
    gcloud compute health-aggregation-policies - manage health aggregation
        policies

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud compute health-aggregation-policies COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage health aggregation policies.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a health aggregation policy.

     delete
        Delete a health aggregation policy.

     describe
        Describe a health aggregation policy.

     list
        List health aggregation policies.

     update
        Update a health aggregation policy.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha compute health-aggregation-policies

        $ gcloud beta compute health-aggregation-policies

